I don't see the problem anyway. Unless your pet is a gelatinous blob,
they'll drop the chest soon enough anyway. Furthermore, you probably
don't spend all that much time on the same level as your stash unless
you're actively working on it, and I would expect those levels to
typically be mostly cleared of monsters.

